&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5pt;padding-right:5pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;海外子会社（NIC Autotec（Thailand）Co.,Ltd.）への増資を実施&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
