&lt;h5 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:22.5pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5"&gt;・ 商品仕入実績&lt;/h6&gt;
